<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
    <dict>
        <key>Description</key>
        <string>This import is NOT verified yet: the download has no hard check (no vendor hash, no signature check). A real run is refused by the shared importer until a verification step exists, unless the override sets pcman_allow_unverified to true (the run then publishes with a WARNING, and the report says published, NOT verified). Hands the downloaded Scratch 3 installer (an EXE) to the package tool (pcman), which publishes it as a new version of the template item into the Cimian repository, or says that nothing is new. For an EXE the package tool is given the version label: the recipe passes the version that ScratchInfoProvider read from the file name that the redirect of the download address names (3.32.1 on 2026-11-13). The file itself is not read for a version; whether its ProductVersion and the version that the installed program reports are the same is NOT established, and whether the package tool checks that an EXE is the same product as the template was NOT established. Whether the installer installs for the whole machine when the client runs it as SYSTEM is NOT established either. This is a dry run, which writes nothing, until the recipe's override sets pcman_dry_run to false.</string>
        <key>Identifier</key>
        <string>com.github.serrc-techops.pcman.Scratch</string>
        <key>Input</key>
        <dict>
            <key>NAME</key>
            <string>Scratch</string>
            <key>PCMAN_TEMPLATE</key>
            <string>scratch</string>
        </dict>
        <key>MinimumVersion</key>
        <string>1.0.0</string>
        <key>ParentRecipe</key>
        <string>com.github.serrc-techops.download.Scratch-Win</string>
        <key>Process</key>
        <array>
            <dict>
                <key>Processor</key>
                <string>com.github.serrc-techops.PcmanProcessors/PcmanImporter</string>
                <key>Arguments</key>
                <dict>
                    <key>pathname</key>
                    <string>%pathname%</string>
                    <key>pcman_template</key>
                    <string>%PCMAN_TEMPLATE%</string>
                    <key>pcman_version</key>
                    <string>%version%</string>
                </dict>
            </dict>
        </array>
    </dict>
</plist>
